{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233650","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233650","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1423365001:1":{"text":"最初、授業を受けるって約束してくれたのはジェミーだけだったの。","source_cn":"一开始，只有詹米一个人答应来上课。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F274CEA4F5A4020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423365002:1":{"text":"だから、一軒一軒家をまわって説得したら……生徒も少しずつ増えたわ。子どもたちも、けっこう楽しみにしてるってジェミーが教えてくれたの。","source_cn":"我就去敲每家每户的门……渐渐的，答应来上课的孩子越来越...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7DEC8A31916EC6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423365003:1":{"text":"あとは、授業をする場所ね。ジェミーの家は狭すぎるし……今後のことを考えると、正直それだけが不安だわ……","source_cn":"我现在唯一担心的就是上课的场所，詹米家肯定坐不下，以后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x418EAA4B89981446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"オーロナ","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}